**(NAKARAT)**
Ya Rabbi, hayati qadir
Kullu shay’in bi yadik sabir
Amali muhimm, waqtun la yantahi
Fi kulli yawm, dhikruka sa’adati

Ya Rabbi, nuruka yadullu qalbi
Fi kulli shay’in, rahmatuka malabi
Amali muhimm, waqtun la yantahi
Fi kulli yawm, dhikruka sa’adati

---

**(1. KITA)**
Shabab yantahi, al-‘umur tamshi
Kullu insan sayalqa qadrihi
Al-hayat ma‘a amal wa sabr
Fi hadhihi’d-dunya nur wa dhikr

Kul yawm nad‘u rabbana bi khushu‘
Wa nas’aluh al-huda wa’l-nur
Amali muhimm, sabru qalbi yartaqi
Wa dhikruhu yudkhil qalbi al-sukkar

